        "locator": "L338-L338 (v1.18.0 › Feature)",
        "excerpt": "- The default value of `Certificate.Spec.PrivateKey.RotationPolicy` changed from `Never` to `Always`. ([`#7723`](https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager/pull/7723), [`@wallrj`](https://github.com/wallrj))",
